@1 = ~Damn it to Nine Hells! Alyth cut me off! Again! It isn't the first time. I keep coming back here hoping she will change her mind… sometimes she does. But I feel like she is becoming less forgiving. But you know what? You look the type to help an honorable man like me out.~
@2 = ~How so?~
@3 = ~I am not interested.~
@4 = ~You could steal the key from Ethon. He is the regular here, and Alyth seems to hold him in high regard. Higher than mine, if you can imagine. Phi! He fetches wine to Alyth from the cellar, and helps out in the kitchen sometimes. That's where you can usually find him. If you could steal the key from him, and pass it to me, I'll give you a unique alcohol. Something so strong, so sweet and so kickin' that you will faint the second it touches your mouth. Interested?~
@5 = ~Easy job. I'll do it for you.~
@6 = ~I am not a thief. You're lucky I don't report you to the guards.~
@9 = ~This is beyond any boundaries of righteousness and legality. <CHARNAME>, I really hope you won't go through with this vile plan. Our job is to protect people, not accept their every request no matter the cost.~
@16 = ~There you are. Took you long enough. You got the key?~
@17 = ~We do. Here you go.~
@18 = ~We do, but we decided we'll give it to you once you pay us. Not before.~
@19 = ~We no longer want to work for you.~
@20 = ~Yes! I hope no one saw you. Last thing I need is Alyth making good on her threats. Here is your reward. Special Cormyrian Liquor. Powerful stuff.~
@21 = ~You cheeky bastard! Stealing penny from poor soul like me. You will suffer karma one day. Fine, have it. Here!~
@22 = ~Phi! Have fun finding a better job offer, than my task.~
@23 = ~Nebbish's Cellar Key Job~
@24 = ~A local drunk called Nebbish from Elfsong Tavern asked me to steal the key to the cellar from a regular patron called Ethon. I should find him in the kitchen.~
@25 = ~I dealt with Nebbish's request.~
@26 = ~Nebbish~
@27 = ~Ethon~
@28 = ~Cellar Key~
@29 = ~A key used to open the cellar door at the Elfsong Tavern.~
@30 = ~Cormyrian Liquor~
@31 = ~This liquor has a strange odour, but a nice smell. It is exceptionally potent and should be consumed with caution.\n\nWisdom +1~

@32 = ~I am still waiting for that key. Come back when you have it.~

@33 = ~You told Ethon everything, didn't you? I asked you to take his key, not run your mouth! Get lost, and don't expect another favour from me.~
